  "actions": [
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-16T01:14:12.598087343-08:00",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": "HOTKEYS:<br/>Turn mousewheel up (ALT-e) - enlarge image of card the mousepointer hovers over<br/>Turn mousewheel down (ALT-s) - enlarge original/alternate image of card the mousepointer hovers over<br/><b>F2</b> - Confirm \"Ok\", \"Yes\" or \"Done\" button<br/><b>F4</b> - Skip current turn but stop on declare attackers/blockers and something on the stack<br/><b>F5</b> - Skip to next end step but stop on declare attackers/blockers and something on the stack<br/><b>F6</b> - Skip current turn but stop on declare attackers/blockers<br/><b>F7</b> - Skip to next main phase but stop on declare attackers/blockers and something on the stack<br/><b>F9</b> - Skip everything until your next turn<br/><b>F11</b> - Skip everything until the end step just prior to your turn<br/><b>F3</b> - Undo F4/F5/F7/F9/F11<br/><b>F12</b> - Switch in/out to chat text field<br/><b>ALT + D</b> - show/hide panel with big card from the right side<br/><b>Hold ALT + E</b> - force to show card popup in image mode<br/><br/>CHAT COMMANDS:<br/><b>/h username </b> - show player's stats (history)<br/><b>/w username message</b> - send private message to player (whisper)<br/><b>/pings</b> - show players and watchers ping<br/><b>/fix</b> - fix frozen game<br/><b>[[card name]]</b> - insert card with popup info",
    },
